       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SPLIT-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 LINE-IN PIC X(20) VALUE "ann,30,nyc".
       01 NM PIC X(5). 
       01 AGE PIC X(3).
       01 CITY PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           UNSTRING LINE-IN DELIMITED BY "," INTO NM AGE CITY
           DISPLAY NM " " AGE " " CITY
           STOP RUN.
